Starting as early as next week, customers who sign up for an Apple Card at Apple's retail stores in the U.S. will receive &#36;249 cash back when they purchase AirPods Pro 3, <a href="https://x.com/markgurman/status/2055310480357638551">according to <em>Bloomberg</em>'s Mark Gurman</a>. The promotion has yet to be officially announced by Apple, so exact terms and conditions are not available at this time. <br/>
<br/>
